<main style="padding: var(--space-12) 0 var(--space-20);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 820px;">
    <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--color-accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
      ABOUT EUREKA
    </div>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.75rem); margin-bottom: var(--space-6); line-height: 1.15;">
      Understanding the ideas behind how we think, feel, and behave.
    </h1>

    <div class="article-prose">
      <p style="font-size: var(--text-lg); line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-foreground);">
        <strong>EUREKA</strong> is a knowledge and exploration platform focused on psychology, human behavior, science, ideas, and the patterns hidden in everyday life.
      </p>

      <p>
        Too much of modern psychology content on social media relies on catchy buzzwords, oversimplified diagnoses, and pop-culture aphorisms. EUREKA was founded to bridge the gap between rigorous scientific research and thoughtful, accessible visual storytelling.
      </p>

      <blockquote>
        "You can understand why you feel attached without allowing the feeling to decide what is healthy for you."
      </blockquote>

      <h2 id="categories">Our Core Disciplines</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>🧠 Psychology:</strong> Human behavior, cognitive biases, memory, emotions, self-awareness, and decision-making.</li>
        <li><strong>❤️ Relationships:</strong> Attachment theory, communication, healthy boundaries, emotional dependency, compatibility, and trust.</li>
        <li><strong>🧬 Human Behavior:</strong> Habits, social dynamics, motivation, reinforcement loops, and behavioral patterns.</li>
        <li><strong>🌌 Mind & Consciousness:</strong> Perception, identity, self-concept, attention, and consciousness.</li>
        <li><strong>📚 Science Explained:</strong> Long-form explanations of psychological, behavioral, and quantum physical research in simple language.</li>
        <li><strong>💭 Philosophy & Ideas:</strong> Questions about identity, meaning, relationships, society, and human experience.</li>
      </ul>

      <hr />

      <h2 id="research">Research & Scientific Sources</h2>
      <p>
        Credibility matters. Every psychology and science article published on EUREKA concludes with a dedicated <strong>Sources & Further Reading</strong> section citing peer-reviewed papers, foundational texts, and academic journals. We believe that curiosity thrives best when grounded in evidence.
      </p>

      <hr />

